{"url": "https://wiki.idlecorp.xyz/api.php?format=json&formatversion=2&action=parse&page=Oil+well&prop=text%7Clinks%7Cimages%7Ctemplates%7Ccategories&redirects=1", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-09T14:55:19.267457+00:00", "body": "{\"parse\":{\"title\":\"Oil well\",\"pageid\":16,\"redirects\":[],\"text\":\"<div class=\\\"mw-parser-output\\\"><table>\\n<tbody><tr>\\n<td>\\n<table class=\\\"wikitable\\\" style=\\\"float:right;max-width: 35%;\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n<th colspan=\\\"2\\\">Cost\\n</th></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Material</b></td>\\n<td>$100, 100x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Iron\\\" title=\\\"Iron\\\">iron</a>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Total Cost</b></td>\\n<td>$500\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<th colspan=\\\"2\\\">Production\\n</th></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Inputs</b></td>\\n<td>N/A\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Outputs</b></td>\\n<td>10x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Crude_oil\\\" title=\\\"Crude oil\\\">crude oil</a>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Production interval</b></td>\\n<td>10 seconds\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Production/Min</b></td>\\n<td>60x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Crude_oil\\\" title=\\\"Crude oil\\\">crude oil</a>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<th colspan=\\\"2\\\">Profit\\n</th></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Profit/Min</b></td>\\n<td>$6.00\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>True Profit/Min</b></td>\\n<td>$6.00\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Profit/Hour</b></td>\\n<td>$360\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Return of Investment/Min</b></td>\\n<td>2%\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>True Return of Investment/Min</b></td>\\n<td>2%\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<th colspan=\\\"2\\\">Aliases\\n</th></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td colspan=\\\"2\\\">oil well, oilwell\\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n<p>The Oil Well is used to harvest crude oil from the ground. The base production is 10 units of oil per 10 seconds.\\n</p>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Building_an_Oil_Well\\\">Building an Oil Well</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Oil_well&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Building an Oil Well\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<p>To build an oil well you will need to use the <code>$$build oil well</code> command. Once you receive a message back front the bot click on the green checkmark reaction to confirm the build. \\n</p>\\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Related_Facilities\\\">Related Facilities</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Oil_well&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Related Facilities\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<p><b>As construction material</b>\\n</p>\\n<ul><li><a href=\\\"/index.php/Oil_refinery\\\" title=\\\"Oil refinery\\\">Oil refinery</a></li></ul>\\n<p><b>As input</b>\\n</p>\\n<div style=\\\"column-count:2;-moz-column-count:2;-webkit-column-count:2\\\">\\n<ul><li><a href=\\\"/index.php/Oil_refinery\\\" title=\\\"Oil refinery\\\">Oil refinery</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/index.php/Rubber_factory\\\" title=\\\"Rubber factory\\\">Rubber factory</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/index.php/Polyester_factory\\\" title=\\\"Polyester factory\\\">Polyester factory</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/index.php/Plastic_factory\\\" title=\\\"Plastic factory\\\">Plastic factory</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/index.php/Research_chemical_factory\\\" title=\\\"Research chemical factory\\\">Research chemical factory</a></li></ul>\\n</div>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Related_Blueprint\\\">Related Blueprint</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Oil_well&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Related Blueprint\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<ul><li><a href=\\\"/index.php/Oil_mapping\\\" title=\